    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041cd4eb9108503c4f89b2e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我来到健身房寻找训练所需的器材。\n却在那里看到了正抱头苦恼的采访组。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be484dcc4515029d07d0c0a63c7eab9277ab1f81656af62017d503caa3e94536",
