    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f0b20816b9eff2d9278227f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样一来，不就和普通的赛马娘没什么\n两样了吗……？说起千明，明明应该是一阵风般\n突然消失，给人留下这样的印象才对啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d091b3f3c64b0ebba81a8eebaef396e897706923edb24225b1b14e9dffd1727",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
