      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是说啊……我们可是做好了\n去追赶那样的千明的心理准备，\n才干劲满满地赶过来的呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c5d54a4b42e3579e79056d0e0666f983aca75a932ed37474eac0c93a864542",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
