    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaaebefde250d738e0b04c7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为千明代表的一句话，\n采访组瞬间斗志昂扬。看来被真正调动起兴致的，\n其实是采访组这一方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9468a43a681039d6a45bf55ecc7e49c2e0db980a74250204b69dbcff2c80b6c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0312/storytimeline_830312001.json",
