    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2815f9269573575e4d31d0e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈，真热血啊。\n……嗯，光是感受到这股热情，\n我就稍微有点提得起劲了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "726dd8f919374afcf821ffc70a44fb1a54ffb373644eede07f782e58971fc0c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
