    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d74ab953c1530dac31831343",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对她来说，在学园里训练\n也不过是一时心血来潮的结果吧。\n——而且。",
      "source_fingerprint": "930b0f009b11e3c92a0ed7290f79ef6f82a4579f85cc7d70dd9e53ba1f0d6891",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
