    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4c6fe153f613a0a7edced1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对千明代表的贴身跟拍就这样开始了。\n我正好奇他们的热情究竟会如何捕捉\n如浪人般无拘无束的她时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "727895ff82219f8cfd345792e9cf57129534d8c3d68c6d250715089856d8e81b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
